// Golden set for evaluation — 100+ questions with expected source chunks.
// Format: one JSON object per line.
// Fields:
//   question: the natural language question
//   expected_answer: reference answer (may be approximate)
//   expected_chunks: list of chunk_ids that should be retrieved
//   ticker: relevant ticker symbol
//   doc_type: "10-K", "10-Q", or "earnings_call"
